  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK granskning BIRN</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre-grant mgmt &amp; control review BIRN - internal control review BIRN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">According to the audit rule, an external review of internal  management and control system shall be undertaken f&#xF6;r cooperation partners that are new to Sida. Sida calls off an auditor to make such a review of the BIRN hub in Sarajevo, as part of the appraisal process in view of a multiannual core support.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Enligt revisionsregelen ska f&#xF6;r Sida nya partners genomg&#xE5; en ISK-&#xF6;versyn innan Sida st&#xF6;d kan utges. Sida avropar d&#xE4;rf&#xF6;r en revisor f&#xF6;r att g&#xF6;ra en ISK av BIRNs hub i Sarajevo (55020253), som en del i beredningen av ett fler&#xE5;rigt k&#xE4;rnst&#xF6;d.</narrative>
  </description>
